 .../rendering/VideoRenderers/RPRendererFBO.h  |  19 +--
 .../VideoRenderers/RPRendererGuiTexture.cpp   |   2 +-
 .../VideoRenderers/RPRendererGuiTexture.h     |  12 +-
 .../VideoRenderers/RPRendererOpenGL.cpp       | 154 +-----------------
 .../VideoRenderers/RPRendererOpenGL.h         |  19 +--
 .../VideoRenderers/RPRendererOpenGLES.cpp     | 142 +---------------
 .../VideoRenderers/RPRendererOpenGLES.h       |  18 +-
